o4Q7kNvwHHouJO&_nc_oc=AdpUkWEBikKyAA_a-5Z4rbU414PADN2sciyrCCz-JC_vVcV2ILDsHZo2XmnwT6AdtHg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-xl1GcI0NmmeHmZT9gdLfcSjzEq1LOMc-NqNqo6l6cgA&oe=6A468251"}, {"file_name": "screenshot4.png", "id": "4383046621951627", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825462_4383046625284960_6704386613672609703_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JZw9At6Mg48Q7kNvwGtM7pW&_nc_oc=AdpbRH3mS6C0pjM6c5DJikv1k646yIM-uyI5UrPuXZxQAhGoV-e5hijrnrCQ6ZZrDUM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-3cxN1O82kSizxVS05J925ItbTYbPa841paKql0yEf0g&oe=6A468935"}, {"file_name": "screenshot5.png", "id": "851768347981596", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825546_851768351314929_2053146473754133296_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Grn_Bpd8VCAQ7kNvwG9bz39&_nc_oc=AdpSDb4Nz-Z5ZH5FjrOHWAXE7vLGB2-8wJL0IKq1tG11ddu2nw84h7IlcHbmGhmAVhA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8rpLwy21fsTLvyoi7Vc3CTThHWBGQYSaIwC6rD3D8Fgw&oe=6A4673C0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1632542594489813", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622285_1632542597823146_3689544893099760675_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HK0kPTeGDlcQ7kNvwFLcrd4&_nc_oc=AdqnHLjY1wXU5G9eoxsH6e4oXlsLYYHvfozvhU9QWve70223_HR3_lv1Y1bUcOJfdtk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_Qvn1o-QcdzhIy__dZ5Rg_COt0Tz34rZdVjTj5a2R1mg&oe=6A465B5D"}, "display_name": "Cortex Quest", "keywords": ["educational", "science", "biology", "ear", "psychology"], "long_description": "**WARNING:** This game must be played by at least 2 people. One player is immersed in VR, while their partner must have the Support File in hand: https://cortexquest.github.io/VR.\n# Train your brain. Become the system.\n\nStep into a VR experience where science meets gameplay. CORTEX QUEST is a collection of immersive mini-games for anyone ready to explore the mysteries of the human brain and sensory systems.\n\n# PSYCHOLOGY SIMULATIONS - Perception is not reality\n\nExperience neurological disorders and how perception can dramatically change.\n\nExplore three fascinating conditions:\n\n- Prosopagnosia - struggle to recognize faces and rely on alternative cues\n- Hemineglect - navigate a world where half of reality seems to disappear\n- Body Ownership Impairment - question what truly belongs to your own body\n\nEach simulation challenges your senses and shows how the brain constructs reality.\n\n# BIOLOGY ADVENTURE - HEAR WE GO!\n\nA scientific accident has changed everything\u2026 Your team of biologists has been miniaturized and sent inside the human body. Your mission: explore the auditory system and uncover how we perceive sound.\n\nEquipped with advanced VR tools, you will:\n\n- Dive into the cochlea and uncover its mechanics\n- Activate hair cells and observe how sound becomes signals\n- Manipulate sound frequencies to understand pitch perception\n- Trigger action potentials and follow neural pathways\n- Travel to the auditory cortex\n\nLearn hearing by doing, experimenting, and interacting.", "short_description": "CORTEX QUEST is an educational two-player VR experience where one player explores the brain and body, while a partner guides them through puzzles about perception, neurological disorders, and hearing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://novascience.github.io/VR/PrivacyPolicy/CortexQuestPrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Dawson College", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.dawsoncollege.qc.ca/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_RE